date-released: 2026-10-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/marijanatomic-rgb/GlagoLab_Glagolitic-manuscripts-of-Zadar-Archdiocese"
url: "https://glagolab.unizd.hr"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained Jupyter notebook for visualising metadata describing
  Glagolitic manuscripts from the Zadar Archdiocese. The metadata originate
  from the GlagoLab catalogue of the Centre for Research in Glagolitism,
  University of Zadar. The notebook generates static and interactive
  visualisations and can be run locally or in Google Colab.
keywords:
  - "Glagolitic manuscripts"
  - "digital humanities"
  - "metadata visualisation"
  - "cultural heritage"
  - "Jupyter notebook"
  - "GlagoLab"
